        <body>
            <div xml:id="d42-a4">

                <pb facs="0833" n="823" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv07/pg823"/>

                <head>Appendix D to HD–37</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation<anchor n="7" xml:id="d42-f1"
                    />]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Note To Be Sent by the Inter-Allied
                        Armistice Commission to the German Government</hi></p>
                <p>The Allied and Associated Governments have decided to send the attached note to
                    the Governments of neutral states, to invite them to take immediate measures
                    with a view to preventing a resumption of commercial relations with Bolshevik
                    Russia.</p>
                <p>The German Government is requested on its part to take similar measures.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
